# The Vercel CLI uploads the working directory, not just git-tracked
# files -- .gitignore alone does not reliably keep something out of a
# deployment. Everything under public/ is then served at the site root,
# with no auth and fully indexable.
#
# atlas-credentials.env holds live MongoDB Atlas credentials and must
# never leave this machine. The rest are unrelated client assets that
# have no business on the Al Quba domain.
public/*.env
public/ascend-marketing-dashboard.html
public/blogs123.docx
public/sharpmindz.png
public/sharpmindz-front.png
